{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2025-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1739577600, "end_date": 1740182399, "month_true_total": 107, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:06:24 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "188451270", "author": {"steamid": "76561197969908751", "personaname": "[FOAD]Iron", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197969908751/", "num_games_owned": 3370, "num_reviews": 478, "playtime_forever": 132, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 62, "last_played": 1762895481, "avatar": "87e29f3bd29d9856a6b3e539993cf457ce9c3ea4"}, "language": "english", "review": "No hold to sprint.\nBoring game.\nOne, long corridor.\nThird-person, console-newbie game.", "timestamp_created": 1740181526, "timestamp_updated": 1740181526, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.408033549785614014", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "188389878", "author": {"steamid": "76561198092628158", "personaname": "Azure", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/azurevacc/", "num_games_owned": 327, "num_reviews": 180, "playtime_forever": 675, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 675, "last_played": 1740119605, "avatar": "2992ae1bbb54aa960ffdaa0890f7f12a4532a43f"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1740119797, "timestamp_updated": 1740119797, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188347124", "author": {"steamid": "76561198038526085", "personaname": "BuriedOnMars", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/buriedonmars/", "num_games_owned": 824, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 525, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 525, "last_played": 1740066983, "avatar": "3b5498300b237a90019af1daa086d46107359337"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game borrows much from the Gears of War franchise.  There is no cover base shooting and hack 'n slash is used instead for the up-close combat. Every other aspect of the game is Gears with posh British accents. The gameplay feels good, even if it does lack polish.  For example, during the close-up \"chainsaw duels,\" the default camera is behind the character, blocking the view. Epic Games knew the camera needed to swing around to see all the action in the Gears series.  The story isn't all that engaging as well.  I didn't feel anything for the world or think much about what it was going through with the Ork invasion.  I'm not a fan of the Warhammer series, and this is the only game I've played in it, so that might be why.  But the gameplay is solid, and the variety of enemies and the mix of weapons kept me invested. I would recommend it to action fans", "timestamp_created": 1740068366, "timestamp_updated": 1740068366, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.493292450904846191", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188297697", "author": {"steamid": "76561198053727322", "personaname": "old qwerty bastard", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fatgoth/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 567, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 382, "last_played": 1740014004, "avatar": "97e463a36f2693f6158631fb69c4074694019c20"}, "language": "english", "review": "Solid third-person-shooter that makes you feel powerful, but still on the edge of danger at any moment. Feels old school in its simplicity by today's standards, but that strongly works in its favor.", "timestamp_created": 1740002115, "timestamp_updated": 1740002115, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188296323", "author": {"steamid": "76561199822932099", "personaname": "theelderhamdragon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199822932099/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 57, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16, "last_played": 1740398781, "avatar": "780661a5d416f8d95f46387e010e3e04af16cf8e"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game will not launch. I've tried about 7 of the 7 or so fixes and nothing has worked. I've had a ticket open for about five days with no response.", "timestamp_created": 1740000531, "timestamp_updated": 1740000531, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}